<section background-color="accent" vertical-align="center" id="bbs007" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>Accent-ground section divider led by a large section number, with the title and one scope line beside it; the ink derives from the fill, so no text color is set. The pair to the accent cover.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item colspan="18" vertical-align="center" id="ZZynVOig_e"><display size="lg">01</display></grid-item><grid-item colspan="42" vertical-align="center" id="QZv1jNM-uW"><h1>Where we are</h1><p font-size="lg">Results against the plan, and what changed since the last review.</p></grid-item></grid></section>